{
 "Testimonies are collected by the project team and published with the storyteller’s consent.": "证词由项目团队采集，并在征得讲述者同意后发布。",
 "Historical records are newspaper articles, reports, photographs and official records, shown with their source.": "历史记录包括报纸文章、报告、照片和官方记录，并注明来源。",
 "Incident records bring together everything the archive holds about one event.": "事件记录汇集了档案中与同一事件有关的全部内容。",
 "The project": "项目介绍",
 "The full name of the project is “Remembering the Waters: Co-creating Kenya’s Maritime and Inland-Water Safety Heritage Archive for Equity, Memory, and Future Transitions”. It works with coastal communities, Lake Victoria communities, survivors and families affected by past incidents, women in fishing communities, youth and informal transport workers, and with safety regulators, heritage institutions and universities.": "项目全称为“Remembering the Waters：为公平、记忆与未来转型共同创建肯尼亚海洋与内陆水域安全遗产档案”。项目与沿海社区、维多利亚湖周边社区、过往事件的幸存者和受影响的家庭、渔业社区的妇女、青年以及非正规运输从业者合作，也与安全监管机构、遗产机构和大学合作。",
 "Acknowledgements": "致谢",
 "The archive is run by the project team with the support of its funders and partner organisations, and it exists because of the people who have trusted it with their stories.": "本档案由项目团队在资助方和合作机构的支持下运营。它之所以存在，是因为人们信任它，把自己的故事托付给了它。",
 "Contact": "联系我们",
 "Message the admins from your": "如需给管理员留言，请前往您的",
 "Sign in to message the admins, or use the": "登录后可给管理员留言，或使用",
 "feedback form": "反馈表单",
 "To report copied or infringing content, use Report on the story, or the feedback form.": "如需举报抄袭或侵权内容，请使用故事上的“举报”功能，或填写反馈表单。",
 "Policies": "政策",
 "Policy briefs, learning summaries, educational materials, the contributor handbook and online exhibitions.": "政策简报、学习摘要、教育材料、贡献者手册和线上展览。",
 "Type": "类型",
 "All types": "全部类型",
