 "Everyone": "所有人",
 "All languages": "全部语言",
 "Search": "搜索",
 "No resources match": "没有符合条件的资源",
 "Download available": "可下载",
 "All resources": "全部资源",
 "Published {date}": "发布于 {date}",
 "Copy citation": "复制引用信息",
 "Suggested citation": "建议引用格式",
 "This policy explains what personal data the archive collects, why, how it is protected and what your rights are. It follows Kenya’s Data Protection Act, 2019.": "本政策说明档案收集哪些个人数据、为何收集、如何保护，以及您享有哪些权利。本政策遵循肯尼亚《2019 年数据保护法》。",
 "What we collect": "我们收集的信息",
 "From Contributors: the name, email address and picture supplied by Google or Apple when you sign in; the username and picture you choose; your language and settings.": "来自贡献者：登录时由 Google 或 Apple 提供的姓名、电子邮箱和头像；您选择的用户名和头像；您的语言和设置。",
 "What you post: stories, files, comments, reactions, messages, reports and safety concerns.": "您发布的内容：故事、文件、评论、感受、消息、举报和安全隐患。",
 "From everyone: basic technical records (pages opened, device type, approximate region from the internet address) used to keep the service safe and to count visits. Visitors are counted without identifying them.": "来自所有人：基本的技术记录（打开的页面、设备类型、根据网络地址得出的大致地区），用于保障服务安全和统计访问量。统计访客时不会识别其身份。",
 "From admins: name, work email, phone number, staff number and, if given, an ID or passport number, which is stored encrypted.": "来自管理员：姓名、工作邮箱、电话号码、工号，以及（如已提供）身份证或护照号码，该号码会加密存储。",
 "Why we use it": "我们为何使用这些信息",
 "To run the archive, show your stories as you choose, keep the community safe through moderation, answer your questions, and report anonymous statistics about the archive. We do not sell personal data and we do not show advertising.": "用于运营档案、按您的选择展示您的故事、通过内容审核保障社区安全、回答您的问题，以及发布有关档案的匿名统计数据。我们不出售个人数据，也不展示广告。",
 "Automated review": "自动审核",
 "Every story and comment is checked by an AI system against the rules. A person on the admin team reviews anything it blocks, and you can ask why through “Ask Why”.": "每个故事和每条评论都会由 AI 系统对照规则进行检查。凡被其拦截的内容，都会由管理员团队的人员复核；您也可以通过“询问原因”了解理由。",
 "Who can see what": "谁能看到什么",
 "Published stories are public. If you post anonymously, your name and picture are not shown, but the admins can still see who posted. Private messages are seen by the people in the conversation; reported messages can be seen by admins. Original files, consent forms and ID numbers are never public.": "已发布的故事是公开的。如果您匿名发布，您的姓名和头像不会显示，但管理员仍能看到发布者是谁。私信只有对话双方可见；被举报的消息管理员可以查看。原始文件、同意书和证件号码绝不会公开。",
 "How it is protected": "如何保护",
 "Connections are encrypted. Files are stored encrypted, checked for viruses, and hidden location data is removed from photos. Admin accounts need a second sign-in step. Actions by admins are recorded in an audit log.": "连接均已加密。文件加密存储并经过病毒检查，照片中隐藏的位置信息会被移除。管理员账号需要通过第二步登录验证。管理员的操作会记入审计日志。",
 "How long we keep it": "保存多久",
 "Your account and content stay until you delete them. A deleted story or account can be restored for 30 days and is then erased. Stories you posted “as told by” someone else, and testimonies given with consent, can be withdrawn at any time by asking the admins.": "您的账号和内容会一直保留，直到您将其删除。已删除的故事或账号在 30 天内可以恢复，之后将被彻底清除。您以“由他人讲述”方式发布的故事，以及经同意提供的证词，可随时向管理员提出撤回。",
 "Your rights": "您的权利",
 "You can see, correct and download your data (My Profile › Download my data), delete your account (My Profile › Delete account), object to how your data is used, and complain to the Office of the Data Protection Commissioner.": "您可以查看、更正和下载您的数据（我的资料 › 下载我的数据）、删除您的账号（我的资料 › 删除账号）、反对对您数据的使用方式，并向数据保护专员办公室投诉。",
 "Children": "儿童",
 "You must be {n} or older to hold an account. Stories about anyone under 18 need the agreement of a parent or guardian, and children are not identified without it.": "您必须年满 {n} 周岁才能拥有账号。涉及未满 18 周岁者的故事须征得其父母或监护人同意；未经同意，不会透露儿童的身份。",
 "Cookies and storage on your device": "Cookie 与设备上的存储",
 "The website uses one sign-in cookie, needed to keep you signed in, and stores your language, theme, drafts and offline copies of pages on your device. It uses no advertising or tracking cookies.": "本网站使用一个登录 Cookie，用于保持您的登录状态，并在您的设备上存储您的语言、主题、草稿和页面的离线副本。本网站不使用任何广告或跟踪 Cookie。",
 "Questions about your data go to the admins through INBOX or the feedback form.": "有关您数据的问题，请通过收件箱或反馈表单向管理员提出。",
 "Feedback form": "反馈表单",
 "Using the archive": "使用档案",
 "Anyone may read, listen to, search and cite the archive free of charge. To post, react, comment, message, follow or report you need an account, which you create by signing in with Google or Apple.": "任何人都可以免费阅读、收听、搜索和引用档案内容。发布、表达感受、评论、发消息、关注或举报则需要账号，使用 Google 或 Apple 登录即可创建。",
 "Your content": "您的内容",
 "You keep the rights to what you post. By posting you allow the archive to store, display, translate, transcribe and preserve it, and to make it available to the public under the usage rights you choose for each story. Post only what you own or have permission to share.": "您保留对所发布内容的权利。发布即表示您允许档案存储、展示、翻译、转写和保存这些内容，并按您为每个故事选择的使用权限向公众提供。请只发布属于您本人或您已获准分享的内容。",
 "Other people’s stories": "他人的故事",
 "If you share a story told to you by someone else, you confirm that they agreed. Either of you can ask for it to be withdrawn.": "如果您分享的是他人讲给您的故事，即表示您确认对方已经同意。你们任何一方都可以要求撤回。",
 "You agree to follow the Rules and netiquette. Content that breaks them may be blocked or removed, and accounts may be warned, suspended or deleted. You can always ask why.": "您同意遵守规则与网络礼仪。违反规则的内容可能被拦截或移除，账号可能被警告、停用或删除。您随时可以询问原因。",
 "Using what you find here": "使用这里的内容",
 "Each story shows its usage rights. Respect them, and cite the archive when you use a story (every story has a “Cite” option). Downloads are offered only where the Contributor allows them.": "每个故事都标明了使用权限。请予以尊重，并在使用故事时注明引自本档案（每个故事都有“引用”选项）。只有在贡献者允许的情况下才提供下载。",
 "Copyright and takedown": "版权与下架",
 "If you believe something here copies your work or was posted without permission, use Report on the story or the feedback form, and say what it is and where the original is. The admins will review it and remove it if the report is right.": "如果您认为这里的某些内容抄袭了您的作品，或是未经许可发布的，请使用故事上的“举报”功能或反馈表单，说明是哪项内容以及原作在哪里。管理员会进行核查，举报属实的将予以移除。",
 "Safety information": "安全信息",
 "Stories describe personal experiences and are not official safety advice. The archive is not an emergency service: in an emergency, call the emergency numbers shown on the safety concern form.": "故事讲述的是个人经历，并非官方安全建议。本档案不是紧急救援服务：遇到紧急情况，请拨打安全隐患表单上列出的紧急电话。",
 "Changes": "变更",
 "If these terms change in an important way, we will tell you in Announcements before the change takes effect.": "如果本条款有重大变更，我们会在变更生效前通过公告告知您。",
